(a)(1)(i) (i) The location description for the immediate subsequent recipient (other than a transporter) of the food;
(a)(1)(ii) (ii) The commodity and, if applicable, variety of the food;
(a)(1)(iii) (iii) The quantity and unit of measure of the food (e.g., 75 bins, 200 pounds);
(a)(1)(iv) (iv) The location description for the farm where the food was harvested;
(a)(1)(v) (v) For produce, the name of the field or other growing area from which the food was harvested (which must correspond to the name used by the grower), or other information identifying the harvest location at least as precisely as the field or other growing area name;
(a)(1)(vi) (vi) For aquacultured food, the name of the container (e.g., pond, pool, tank, cage) from which the food was harvested (which must correspond to the container name used by the aquaculture farmer) or other information identifying the harvest location at least as precisely as the container name;
